* {{vern|Chinese sweetgum}} (''[[Liquidambar formosana]]'')
* {{vern|Formosan sweetgum}} (''[[Liquidambar formosana]]'')
* {{l|en|oriental sweetgum}} (''[[Liquidambar orientalis]]'')
* {{vern|Turkish sweetgum}} (''[[Liquidambar orientalis]]'')

